  author = {Jose Alejandro Luchsinger and Samuel P. Rosin and Erin J. Kazemi and Naji Younes and Colleen E. Suratt and Basma N. Fattaleh and Hermes J. Florez and Jeffrey S. Gonzalez and Priscilla Hollander and Sophia H. Hox and Shihchen Kuo and Melissa S. Lee and Thomas W. Martens and Rodica Pop‐Busui and Elizabeth R. Seaquist and Andrea H. Waltje and Joshua I. Barzilay and Jill P. Crandall and Melissa Diane McKee and Stephanie Beringher and Janet Brown-Friday and Entila Xhori and Keisha Ballentine-Cargill and Sally Duran and H. Estrella and S. Gonzalez de la torre and Jennifer Lukin and Lawrence S. Phillips and Elizabeth Burgess and Darin E. Olson and Mary K. Rhee and Peter W.F. Wilson and Tasha Stephanie Raines and J. Boers and Julie Costello and Maxine Maher-Albertelli and Radhika Mungara and Louise Savoye and Carol Ann White and Chona Gullett and Leah Holloway and Folayan Morehead and Saranjit Person and Mabil Sibymon and Sridhar Tanukonda and Cynthia Adams and April Ross and Ashok Balasubramanyam and Ruchi Gaba and ERICA V. GONZALEZ and Adrienne Ideozu and Julizza Jimenez and Gabriela Montes and Charlyne Wright and Priscilla Hollander and Erin D. Roe and A. Jackson and Ashley Smiley and Polly Burt and Lorie Estrada and Kris Chionh and Faramarz Ismail‐Beigi and Corinna Falck-Ytter and Laure Sayyed Kassem and Ajay Sood and Margaret Tiktin and Bethany Cramer and Jacalyn Iacoboni and Maria V. Kononets and Tanya Kulow and Cynthia Newman and Katherine A. Stancil and Cristina Sanders and Lisa Tucker and Amanda Werner and Adrienne Krol and Gloria McPhee and Christine Patel and Linda Colosimo and Audrey Maxwell and Robin Goland and James Pring and Lucia Alfano and Patricia Kringas and Camille Hausheer and Jéssica Tejada and Kelly Gumpel and Amanda Kirpitch and Harvey A. Schneier and Jennifer B. Green and Hiba AbouAssi and Ranee Chatterjee and Mark N. Feinglos and Jennifer English Jones and Shubi A. Khan and Jeanne B. Kimpel and Ronna P. Zimmer and Mary Furst and Barbara M. Satterwhite and Connie R. Thacker},
